config BR2_PACKAGE_CADR_CONSOLE
	bool "cadr-console"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_CADR_COMMON
	help
	  The console: the program on the processing system that halts
	  the CADR, reads its sixteen diagnostic registers and starts it
	  again, over M_AXI_GP1.  Its vocabulary is muir's spy module's
	  with no translation in between.

	  It is INTERACTIVE and has no init script: a console that ran
	  unasked would be a second master on the diagnostic bus for as
	  long as the board was up.
